1
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:15,182
But it's not more
than a friend

2
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:27,069
I told you I need a rest
when the movie is over

3
00:00:27,194 --> 00:00:28,389
You don't need
to do it right now

4
00:00:28,413 --> 00:00:30,239
Let's just review
the script, huh?

5
00:00:30,364 --> 00:00:31,864
Jihoon will bring it
to you tomorrow

6
00:00:31,948 --> 00:00:33,158
Please just
take a look, okay?

7
00:00:33,283 --> 00:00:34,785
Got it

8
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:35,994
Okay, have a good rest

9
00:00:44,503 --> 00:00:45,503
Shin Yoo-il

10
00:00:47,339 --> 00:00:49,675
you thought you're
his real boyfriend?

11
00:00:51,802 --> 00:00:53,095
Yes, Manager

12
00:00:55,305 --> 00:00:56,305
What are you doing?

13
00:00:59,726 --> 00:01:00,978
I heard
you left earlier

14
00:01:02,521 --> 00:01:04,022
I didn't wanna
get in the way

15
00:01:06,316 --> 00:01:07,734
Have you been drinking?

16
00:01:07,859 --> 00:01:10,862
No, I haven't

17
00:01:10,988 --> 00:01:12,572
Then…

18
00:01:12,698 --> 00:01:13,698
what's the occasion?

19
00:01:15,242 --> 00:01:17,452
Do I need an occasion
to call you?

20
00:01:19,955 --> 00:01:22,124
No, I mean… You can
call me anytime, but…

21
00:01:22,249 --> 00:01:23,249
I miss you

22
00:01:28,046 --> 00:01:29,631
I called you
because I miss you
